; THE COCKPIT SITS AHEAD OF AND ABOVE THE AIRFRAME, which it did not have to at
; 0.28 m: a camera buried in a palm-sized body was clipped away by the near
; plane and nobody noticed. At 3 m the same offset puts the lens inside a solid
; hull and the nose marker fills the screen. Scaling a camera OFFSET is not the
; same as scaling a camera POSITION - this one has to clear geometry.
[node name="FpvCamera" type="Camera3D" parent="."]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0.85, -1.85)
current = true
near = 0.2

